{"type":"message","id":"8068f940","parentId":"81db4402","timestamp":"2026-09-05T13:37:52.391Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看起來**不是** `.vscode/settings.json` 造成的。\n\n這份設定沒有檔案監看（file watcher）相關項目；錯誤通常是 Linux 的 inotify watcher 數量上限不足，尤其這個 workspace 有多個 repo、`node_modules` 等大量檔案時。\n\n先依 VS Code 錯誤通知的 instructions link 操作；通常會是提高：\n\n```bash\nfs.inotify.max_user_watches\n```\n\n例如：\n\n```bash\necho fs.inotify.max_user_watches=524288 | sudo tee /etc/sysctl.d/40-vscode.conf\nsudo sysctl --system\n```\n\n然後重開 VS Code。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0a2282a48d3db44e016a9c1b2d9d7887d09e4b768f892b62cc\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","usage":{"input":972,"output":153,"cacheRead":4608,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":5733,"cost":{"input":0.001944,"output":0.001836,"cacheRead":0.0009216000000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0047016}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788615466391,"responseId":"resp_0a2282a48d3db44e016a9c1b2cd0e087d09c436f4f78b06658","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
