\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Explaining watcher exclusions and worktree impacts**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"建議：**先提高 inotify 上限，再針對不需要即時刷新的大型目錄排除 watcher。** 兩者不衝突。\n\n- `max_user_watches=524288`：對開發機通常很合理，解決根本的系統額度問題。\n- 排除 `node_modules`、build artifacts、cache：減少長期消耗與 VS Code 掃描負擔。\n- **一直開很多 worktree 會有影響**：每個被 VS Code 開啟／納入 workspace 的 worktree 都會增加檔案監看與 Git 掃描；關掉暫時不用的視窗或移出 `.code-workspace`，能明顯降低用量。\n\n可加入 workspace 設定（依專案實際目錄調整）：\n\n```jsonc\n\"files.watcherExclude\": {\n  \"**/node_modules/**\": true,\n  \"**/.svelte-kit/**\": true,\n  \"**/build/**\": true,\n  \"**/dist/**\": true,\n  \"**/.venv/**\": true,\n  \"**/__pycache__/**\": true\n}\n```\n\n注意不要排除你需要讓 VS Code 立即偵測變動的原始碼或資料目錄。`node_modules` 通常不需要監看；套件更新後重載視窗即可。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0a2282a48d3db44e016a9c1b74ad1c87d0aba033affa58f79d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","usage":{"input":1160,"output":392,"cacheRead":4608,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":90,"totalTokens":6160,"cost":{"input":0.00232,"output":0.004704,"cacheRead":0.0009216000000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0079456}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788615536613,"responseId":"resp_0a2282a48d3db44e016a9c1b71722c87d0a7396f06ffe07882","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
