{"type":"message","id":"2c278e7d","parentId":"06fd7746","timestamp":"2026-09-05T13:42:27.278Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"對，Explorer 與主要檔案監看範圍是這兩個資料夾：\n\n- `fgcnote-sf6-mod/`\n- `fgcNote/`\n\nworkspace 根目錄沒有被列進 `folders`，所以不會遞迴掃整個 workspace（例如 `MMDK/` 不在此範圍）。\n\n但這行：\n\n```jsonc\n\"git.openRepositoryInParentFolders\": \"always\"\n```\n\n會讓 VS Code 額外偵測、顯示父目錄的 workspace Git repo；它是 Git repository discovery，不代表把根目錄完整加進 Explorer／檔案 watcher 範圍。\n\n所以 watcher 壓力主要仍來自這兩個 repo 裡的 `node_modules`、`.svelte-kit`、Python `.venv`、生成輸出等。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0a2282a48d3db44e016a9c1c3fc4c887d0a30badfdd94bd7f6\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","usage":{"input":749,"output":190,"cacheRead":5632,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":6571,"cost":{"input":0.001498,"output":0.00228,"cacheRead":0.0011264,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0049044}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788615741464,"responseId":"resp_0a2282a48d3db44e016a9c1c3edd1487d090ef1b600b3fa16b","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
